### 🚀 Key Projects

#### [Last.fm Predictive Suite](https://github.com/zachypoo138-hub/LastFM-python)
- **Overview:** An AI-driven analytics engine forecasting listener engagement trends.
- **Implementation:** Engineered an **Idempotent Sync Loop** to maintain a high-fidelity data vault via the Last.fm REST API.
- **Analytics:** Utilizes **Linear Regression** to model longitudinal listening habits and predict future activity.

#### [Linux From Scratch (LFS) 
- **Overview:** Built a functional, source-based Linux distribution from the ground up.
- **Focus:** Manual dependency resolution, kernel optimization, and toolchain compilation.
- **Outcome:** A deep understanding of the Linux boot process and low-level system interactions.

#### [Automated News Archive](https://github.com/zachypoo138-hub/ScrapeBeast)
- **Overview:** Regional news aggregator with automated data sanitization.
- **Impact:** Developed a custom HTML parser to convert web-based regional news into clean, local archives for offline research.

